{
  "_about": "The single source of truth for Insulin Buddy's look. `node tools/make-tokens.mjs` turns this into tokens.css (the web app) and design/DesignTokens.swift (the future iOS app). Change a value here, regenerate, and the whole app follows. Never edit those two generated files by hand.",
